.TH tokenizer_get_flags 3 "Version 1.0" "December 2023" "lib/tokenizer"
.SH NAME
tokenizer_get_flags \- Get the flags of a tokenizer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <lib/tokenizer.h>
.sp
.BI "int tokenizer_get_flags(tokenizer* t)"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The function .BR tokenizer_get_flags () retrieves the flags of a tokenizer. The function takes the following parameter:
.sp
1. A pointer to the tokenizer.
.sp
The function returns the flags as an int value.
.SH RETURN VALUE
The flags as an int value.
.SH EXAMPLES
No examples are provided for this function.
